Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:58:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/35] app-list: hide taskbar apps only while the taskbar runs

Hiding was on whenever the taskbar binary was installed, so with the
taskbar removed from the panel or crashed those apps were listed
nowhere. Every 2 s the App List now checks that the taskbar's pid file
names a live cosmic-applet-minimize-ws process, and shows the apps
again when it does not.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BLrpLktNVQBZowKMy1ebh2

